OL,3,GNEWSATeacher struck off over 'low-cut
OL,4,Acrop top' comment to pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former teacher has been struck off
OL,7,Fafter a panel heard he told one pupil
OL,8,Fhe would only attend the school show if
OL,9,Fshe was wearing a "low-cut crop top and
OL,10,Ftight trousers".
OL,12,FThe General Teaching Council Scotland
OL,13,F(GTCS) held a hearing into allegations
OL,14,Fagainst John Kerr while he was employed
OL,15,Fat Berwickshire High School teaching
OL,16,Fhistory and modern studies more than
OL,17,Fseven years ago.
OL,19,FThe 75-year-old denied the claims and
OL,20,Fsaid the conversation had not happened.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
