OL,4,Acrop top' comment to pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the panel found the allegation
OL,7,Fhad been proved - along with a number
OL,8,Fof others - and concluded he should be
OL,9,Fremoved from the teaching register for
OL,10,Fa year.
